# Line endings for everything under cpp/.
#
# Store text files with LF in the repository AND keep them as LF in the
# working copy, whatever core.autocrlf is set to on this machine. This stops
# git's "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings, and keeps the Makefile and
# shell-style commands working with LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch line endings in binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.bin binary
*.glb binary
